{"scripts":[{"id":"start-run-kickoff","title":"The Whim's First Fragment","summary":"The Whim gives its newly restored goblin a shape, a purpose, and a first destination.","tags":["lore"],"trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"mystic_cave","tags":["kickoff"]},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/mystic_cave.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/goblin/primordial/frame_0.png"},{"id":"whim","side":"right","name":"The Whim","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/whim/base/frame_0.png","party":"neutral","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"whim-there-you-are","steps":[{"id":"whim-there-you-are","speaker_id":"whim","text":"There you are.","next_step_id":"player-where"},{"id":"player-where","speaker_id":"player","text":"Where am I?","next_step_id":"whim-pocket"},{"id":"whim-pocket","speaker_id":"whim","text":"In the last warm pocket of chaos left in this miserable, well-organized world.","next_step_id":"player-what"},{"id":"player-what","speaker_id":"player","text":"What am I?","next_step_id":"whim-goblin"},{"id":"whim-goblin","speaker_id":"whim","text":"A goblin.","next_step_id":"player-silence"},{"id":"player-silence","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","next_step_id":"whim-mostly"},{"id":"whim-mostly","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Mostly.","next_step_id":"player-mostly"},{"id":"player-mostly","speaker_id":"player","text":"Mostly?","next_step_id":"whim-fragment"},{"id":"whim-fragment","speaker_id":"whim","text":"The Archivist erased goblinkind. I rebuilt what I could from a fragment he missed.","next_step_id":"player-last"},{"id":"player-last","speaker_id":"player","text":"So I am the last goblin?","next_step_id":"whim-moment"},{"id":"whim-moment","speaker_id":"whim","text":"For the moment.","next_step_id":"whim-unfinished"},{"id":"whim-unfinished","speaker_id":"whim","text":"You still look unfinished. Hold still.","next_step_id":"player-reveal"},{"id":"player-reveal","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","enter_effect":{"kind":"player_reveal","initial_overlay_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/goblin/primordial/frame_0.png","final_overlay_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/goblin/base/frame_0.png","resulting_player_portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/goblin/base/frame_0.png","initial_duration_ms":700,"flash_count":2,"flash_interval_ms":180,"between_overlays_ms":220,"final_hold_ms":2000},"next_step_id":"whim-worse"},{"id":"whim-worse","speaker_id":"whim","text":"There. Much worse.","next_step_id":"whim-perfect"},{"id":"whim-perfect","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Perfect.","next_step_id":"whim-once"},{"id":"whim-once","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Once, goblins crawled into every crack in the world. Under doors. Inside walls. Occasionally into soup.","next_step_id":"whim-archivist"},{"id":"whim-archivist","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Then the Archivist arrived with soldiers, shelves, and a dangerous respect for straight lines.","next_step_id":"whim-orderly"},{"id":"whim-orderly","speaker_id":"whim","text":"He made the world orderly.","next_step_id":"player-awful"},{"id":"player-awful","speaker_id":"player","text":"Sounds awful.","next_step_id":"whim-unbearable"},{"id":"whim-unbearable","speaker_id":"whim","text":"It has been unbearable.","next_step_id":"whim-mission"},{"id":"whim-mission","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Go make more goblins. Break tidy things. Recover whatever chaos he failed to catalogue.","next_step_id":"whim-farm"},{"id":"whim-farm","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Start at the Farm. The Mudking is holding an old associate of mine—the Tooth Collector.","next_step_id":"player-ready"},{"id":"player-ready","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","choices":[{"id":"violence","label":"I'll break his crown.","next_step_id":"whim-violence"},{"id":"greed","label":"Does a Mudking have valuable teeth?","next_step_id":"whim-greed"},{"id":"goblin-logic","label":"Can I be Mudking after?","next_step_id":"whim-goblin-logic"}]},{"id":"whim-violence","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Excellent. Try not to break the Collector with him.","next_step_id":"whim-off-you-go"},{"id":"whim-greed","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Now you sound like a goblin.","next_step_id":"whim-off-you-go"},{"id":"whim-goblin-logic","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Probably. Kingship is mostly confidence and surviving witnesses.","next_step_id":"whim-off-you-go"},{"id":"whim-off-you-go","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Off you go, little fragment.","next_step_id":"whim-catalogue"},{"id":"whim-catalogue","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Make the world difficult to catalogue."}]},{"id":"farm-boss-intro-shop-unlocked","trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"the_farm","tags":["shop-unlocked"]},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/farm.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"mudking","side":"right","name":"Mudking","portrait_unit_slug":"mudking","party":"enemy","role":"npc"},{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player"}],"start_step_id":"mudking-return","steps":[{"id":"mudking-return","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"You again.","next_step_id":"mudking-damage"},{"id":"mudking-damage","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"The Collector is gone, three fences are down, and the piglets have started hiding teeth under their bedding.","next_step_id":"mudking-want"},{"id":"mudking-want","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"What could you possibly want now?","next_step_id":"player-answer"},{"id":"player-answer","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","choices":[{"id":"violence","label":"A rematch.","next_step_id":"mudking-violence"},{"id":"greed","label":"The rest of your teeth.","next_step_id":"mudking-greed"},{"id":"goblin-logic","label":"Checking whether I'm Mudking yet.","next_step_id":"mudking-logic"}]},{"id":"mudking-violence","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Good. This time I start with the stomping.","next_step_id":"mudking-enough"},{"id":"mudking-greed","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Still attached. Come count them.","next_step_id":"mudking-enough"},{"id":"mudking-logic","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"You are not Mudking! You don't even own mud!","next_step_id":"mudking-enough"},{"id":"mudking-enough","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Enough. Back into the pen.","next_step_id":"mudking-gate"},{"id":"mudking-gate","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"This time I'm locking the gate behind you."}]},{"id":"mystic-cave-wrong-machine-reminder","title":"A Marvelous Defect","summary":"The Whim points its fragment toward the Wrong Machine and offers exactly enough warning to make it irresistible.","trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"mystic_cave"},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/mystic_cave.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/goblin/base/frame_0.png"},{"id":"whim","side":"right","name":"The Whim","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/whim/base/frame_0.png","party":"neutral","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"whim-still-here","steps":[{"id":"whim-still-here","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Still here? Careful. A goblin who stands still too long becomes furniture.","next_step_id":"player-wrong-machine"},{"id":"player-wrong-machine","speaker_id":"player","text":"You mentioned a Wrong Machine.","next_step_id":"whim-device"},{"id":"whim-device","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Yes. An old device that turns what is into what ought not be.","next_step_id":"whim-defect"},{"id":"whim-defect","speaker_id":"whim","text":"A marvelous defect.","next_step_id":"player-how"},{"id":"player-how","speaker_id":"player","text":"How will I know it?","next_step_id":"whim-sensible"},{"id":"whim-sensible","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Every sensible part of you will say, ‘That should not work.’","next_step_id":"whim-climb"},{"id":"whim-climb","speaker_id":"whim","text":"The rest of you will want to climb inside.","next_step_id":"whim-return"},{"id":"whim-return","speaker_id":"whim","text":"Find it, resist that second impulse, and come back to me.","next_step_id":"whim-order"},{"id":"whim-order","speaker_id":"whim","text":"In that order, preferably."}]},{"id":"farm-boss-intro","trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"the_farm"},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/farm.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"mudking","side":"right","name":"Mudking","portrait_unit_slug":"mudking","party":"enemy","role":"npc"},{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player"}],"start_step_id":"mudking-stop","steps":[{"id":"mudking-stop","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Stop! You're standing in my prize mud.","next_step_id":"mudking-goblins"},{"id":"mudking-goblins","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Goblins. Of course. Nothing else finds a gate and climbs the fence beside it.","next_step_id":"mudking-claim"},{"id":"mudking-claim","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"I am the Mudking. This is my farm, my mud, and my prisoner.","next_step_id":"mudking-business"},{"id":"mudking-business","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"State your business.","next_step_id":"player-answer"},{"id":"player-answer","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","choices":[{"id":"violence","label":"I'm taking the Tooth Collector. Try and stop me.","next_step_id":"mudking-violence"},{"id":"greed","label":"Hand over the Collector and I might leave you your tusks.","next_step_id":"mudking-greed"},{"id":"goblin-logic","label":"The Whim says he's ours. The Whim outranks mud.","next_step_id":"mudking-logic"}]},{"id":"mudking-violence","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Gladly.","next_step_id":"mudking-prisoner"},{"id":"mudking-greed","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"My tusks have names, runt. Yours will be compost.","next_step_id":"mudking-prisoner"},{"id":"mudking-logic","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Nothing outranks the Mudking on his own mud!","next_step_id":"mudking-prisoner"},{"id":"mudking-prisoner","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"The Collector stays in the sty. You can leave standing, or stay as feed.","next_step_id":"player-no"},{"id":"player-no","speaker_id":"player","text":"No.","next_step_id":"mudking-pigs"},{"id":"mudking-pigs","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Good. The pigs were getting bored."}]},{"id":"mountains-archivist-first-contact","title":"The Archivist Takes Notice","summary":"The Archivist discovers that goblins still exist and decides the record must be corrected.","tags":["lore"],"trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"mountains","tags":["first-visit"]},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/mountain.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player"},{"id":"archivist","side":"right","name":"The Archivist","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/archivist/base/frame_0.png","party":"neutral","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"archivist-extinct","steps":[{"id":"archivist-extinct","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"A living goblin.","next_step_id":"archivist-concluded"},{"id":"archivist-concluded","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"No. That matter was concluded.","next_step_id":"archivist-sealed"},{"id":"archivist-sealed","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Your extinction was witnessed, indexed, and sealed.","next_step_id":"archivist-survivor"},{"id":"archivist-survivor","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"You are not a survivor. Survivors belong to events with uncertain endings.","next_step_id":"archivist-error"},{"id":"archivist-error","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"You are an error.","next_step_id":"player-response"},{"id":"player-response","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","choices":[{"id":"violence","label":"Try vanishing me yourself.","next_step_id":"archivist-violence"},{"id":"greed","label":"Extinct things get to keep what they find, yes?","next_step_id":"archivist-greed"},{"id":"goblin-logic","label":"Can't be extinct. I'm using my legs.","next_step_id":"archivist-logic"}]},{"id":"archivist-violence","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"That is precisely what I intend.","next_step_id":"archivist-errors"},{"id":"archivist-greed","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"The property of an extinct people has already been reassigned.","next_step_id":"archivist-errors"},{"id":"archivist-logic","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"An error does not become correct merely because it is ambulatory.","next_step_id":"archivist-errors"},{"id":"archivist-errors","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Still, errors have their uses.","next_step_id":"archivist-reveal"},{"id":"archivist-reveal","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"They reveal where the record first failed.","next_step_id":"archivist-whim"},{"id":"archivist-whim","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"The Whim has begun revising the world again.","next_step_id":"archivist-mudking"},{"id":"archivist-mudking","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Perhaps the Mudking saw where the ink began to run.","next_step_id":"archivist-go"},{"id":"archivist-go","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Go on, goblin.","next_step_id":"archivist-citation"},{"id":"archivist-citation","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Every footprint is a citation."}]},{"id":"mountains-wrong-machine-search-repeat","title":"The High Pass Search","summary":"A kobold scout warns the goblin about the unsafe but functional machine hidden beyond the pass.","trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"mountains"},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/mountain.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player"},{"id":"kobold-scout","side":"right","name":"Kobold Scout","portrait_unit_slug":"kobold_scout","party":"enemy","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"scout-stop","steps":[{"id":"scout-stop","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"Stop at the marker stone.","next_step_id":"scout-traps"},{"id":"scout-traps","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"The next six steps are trapped. The seventh is merely unstable.","next_step_id":"player-machine"},{"id":"player-machine","speaker_id":"player","text":"Good. I was worried it was only a warning.","next_step_id":"scout-not-reassurance"},{"id":"scout-not-reassurance","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"That was not reassurance.","next_step_id":"scout-gouges"},{"id":"scout-gouges","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"You are following those gouges, yes?","next_step_id":"scout-tool-marks"},{"id":"scout-tool-marks","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"Goblin tool marks. Uneven depth, no guide line, and somehow pointed exactly where they need to go.","next_step_id":"scout-south"},{"id":"scout-south","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"They continue south, where the pass sinks into swamp.","next_step_id":"scout-machine"},{"id":"scout-machine","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"There is a machine at the end of them.","next_step_id":"player-good-machine"},{"id":"player-good-machine","speaker_id":"player","text":"A good machine?","next_step_id":"scout-description"},{"id":"scout-description","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"It has mismatched gears, reversed housings, and no measurable operating tolerance.","next_step_id":"scout-works"},{"id":"scout-works","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"So naturally, it still works.","next_step_id":"scout-do-not-touch"},{"id":"scout-do-not-touch","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"Do not touch it.","next_step_id":"player-heard"},{"id":"player-heard","speaker_id":"player","text":"I heard \"works.\"","next_step_id":"scout-of-course"},{"id":"scout-of-course","speaker_id":"kobold-scout","text":"Of course you did."}]},{"id":"mountains-kobold-machine-trail","title":"Kobold Evidence","summary":"A kobold sentry identifies old goblin tool marks and traces the Wrong Machine toward the Swamps.","tags":["lore"],"trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"mountains","tags":["lore"]},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/mountain.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player"},{"id":"kobold-sentry","side":"right","name":"Kobold Sentry","portrait_unit_slug":"kobold_scout","party":"enemy","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"sentry-findings","steps":[{"id":"sentry-findings","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"These cuts were made with a three-tooth claw chisel.","next_step_id":"sentry-pattern"},{"id":"sentry-pattern","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"Old goblin pattern.","next_step_id":"sentry-method"},{"id":"sentry-method","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"No measured spacing. No consistent pressure. No concern for the continued existence of the operator.","next_step_id":"player-wrong"},{"id":"player-wrong","speaker_id":"player","text":"Wrong like broken, or wrong like interesting?","next_step_id":"sentry-interesting"},{"id":"sentry-interesting","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"Interesting first.","next_step_id":"sentry-broken"},{"id":"sentry-broken","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"Broken immediately afterward.","next_step_id":"sentry-trail"},{"id":"sentry-trail","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"The marks lead toward the swamp. Whatever made them was dragged there intact.","next_step_id":"sentry-machine"},{"id":"sentry-machine","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"The machine was designed to reject every stable configuration placed inside it.","next_step_id":"player-output"},{"id":"player-output","speaker_id":"player","text":"What comes out?","next_step_id":"sentry-less-stable"},{"id":"sentry-less-stable","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"Something less stable.","next_step_id":"player-useful"},{"id":"player-useful","speaker_id":"player","text":"Useful.","next_step_id":"sentry-response"},{"id":"sentry-response","speaker_id":"kobold-sentry","text":"That response is why we stopped building with goblins."}]},{"id":"mountains-swamps-lead","title":"Toward the Swamps","summary":"The mountains reveal that the path to the Wrong Machine runs through the Swamps.","tags":["lore"],"trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"mountains","tags":["lore"]},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/mountain.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"player","side":"left","party":"player","role":"player"},{"id":"archivist","side":"right","name":"The Archivist","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/archivist/base/frame_0.png","party":"neutral","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"archivist-warning","steps":[{"id":"archivist-warning","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"You have mistaken my silence for inattention.","next_step_id":"archivist-evidence"},{"id":"archivist-evidence","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Scratches followed through the pass. Wards disturbed. Kobolds questioned with very little subtlety.","next_step_id":"archivist-machine"},{"id":"archivist-machine","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"You are searching for the Wrong Machine.","next_step_id":"archivist-possibility"},{"id":"archivist-possibility","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"It takes settled things and returns them to possibility.","next_step_id":"archivist-revision"},{"id":"archivist-revision","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"An engine of unauthorized revision.","next_step_id":"player-thread"},{"id":"player-thread","speaker_id":"player","text":"...","choices":[{"id":"violence","label":"Tell the Bog Tyrant I'm coming.","next_step_id":"archivist-violence"},{"id":"greed","label":"Does the machine make teeth?","next_step_id":"archivist-greed"},{"id":"goblin-logic","label":"Forbidden means nobody else called dibs.","next_step_id":"archivist-logic"}]},{"id":"archivist-violence","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"He has already been informed. He seemed pleased.","next_step_id":"archivist-location"},{"id":"archivist-greed","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"It produces consequences. You may find those more difficult to spend.","next_step_id":"archivist-location"},{"id":"archivist-logic","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Forbidden means all claims have been superseded by disposal.","next_step_id":"archivist-location"},{"id":"archivist-location","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"The machine lies below, where the mountains sink into stagnant water.","next_step_id":"archivist-guard"},{"id":"archivist-guard","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"The Bog Tyrant guards it—not from thieves, but from use.","next_step_id":"archivist-discrepancy"},{"id":"archivist-discrepancy","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Until now, you were an isolated discrepancy.","next_step_id":"archivist-amendment"},{"id":"archivist-amendment","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Touch that machine, and you become an amendment.","next_step_id":"archivist-remove"},{"id":"archivist-remove","speaker_id":"archivist","text":"Unauthorized amendments are removed."}]},{"id":"farm-shop-unlock","title":"The Tooth Collector Freed","summary":"The defeated Mudking releases the Tooth Collector, unlocking the exchange of teeth for useful goods.","tags":["lore"],"trigger":{"scene":"run-dialogue","node_type":"dialogue","region_slug":"the_farm","tags":["shop-unlocked"]},"presentation":{"background_url":"/assets/ui/biome/farm.png"},"speakers":[{"id":"tooth-collector","side":"left","name":"The Tooth Collector","portrait_url":"/assets/ui/units/animated/tooth_collector/base/frame_0.png","party":"neutral","role":"npc"},{"id":"mudking","side":"right","name":"Mudking","portrait_unit_slug":"mudking","party":"enemy","role":"npc"}],"start_step_id":"mudking-release","steps":[{"id":"mudking-release","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Fine! Take him.","next_step_id":"mudking-jars"},{"id":"mudking-jars","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"Take his jars. Take the little tags he tied to everything.","next_step_id":"collector-records"},{"id":"collector-records","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"Those are records.","next_step_id":"mudking-tusk"},{"id":"mudking-tusk","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"You tagged my left tusk \"pending acquisition.\"","next_step_id":"collector-crack"},{"id":"collector-crack","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"It has a concerning crack.","next_step_id":"mudking-out"},{"id":"mudking-out","speaker_id":"mudking","text":"OUT.","next_step_id":"collector-approve"},{"id":"collector-approve","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"A decisive extraction, goblin. I approve.","next_step_id":"collector-offer"},{"id":"collector-offer","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"Bring me the teeth you collect. I will weigh them, sort them, and exchange them for useful things.","next_step_id":"collector-most"},{"id":"collector-most","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"Most teeth are merely valuable.","next_step_id":"collector-memory"},{"id":"collector-memory","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"Some remember what they bit.","next_step_id":"collector-worth"},{"id":"collector-worth","speaker_id":"tooth-collector","text":"Those are worth considerably more."}]}]}
